      "id": "xxh-128-is-equal",
      "name": "XXH128_isEqual",
      "category": "xxhash",
      "signature": "XXH128_isEqual(H 1, H 2)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "H 1",
          "type": "XXH128_hash_t"
        },
        {
          "name": "H 2",
          "type": "XXH128_hash_t"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Int",
      "docs": "Following helper functions make it possible to compare XXH128_hast_t values.\nSince XXH128_hash_t is a structure, this capability is not offered by the language.\nNote: For better performance, these functions can be inlined using XXH_INLINE_ALL"
    },
    {
      "id": "xxh-128-cmp",
      "name": "XXH128_cmp",
      "category": "xxhash",
      "signature": "XXH128_cmp(H 128 1, H 128 2)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "H 128 1",
          "type": "void*"
        },
        {
          "name": "H 128 2",
          "type": "void*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Int",
      "docs": "!\nXXH128_cmp():\nThis comparator is compatible with stdlib's `qsort()`/`bsearch()`.\nreturn: >0 if *h128_1  > *h128_2\n=0 if *h128_1 == *h128_2\n<0 if *h128_1  < *h128_2"
    },
